80721306,"text":"それと英雄のパイモン、俺たち三人以外、誰にも手を出すことはできない。","nextNodeIds":[710820211]},{"nodeId":710820211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20553,"speakerName":"何爺","textMapHash":1920107770,"text":"宝盗団の残党め！","nextNodeIds":[710820212]},{"nodeId":710820212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20552,"speakerName":"「唐無仇」と自称する者","textMapHash":3457668018,"text":"老いぼれた賊め！","nextNodeIds":[710820213]},{"nodeId":710820213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3168972138,"text":"まあまあ、何爺、唐無仇はもう足を洗って、宝盗団の仕事はしないんだ。それに、彼が植えたのはキノコじゃくてお花だぞ。","nextNodeIds":[710820214]},{"nodeId":710820214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20553,"speakerName":"何爺","textMapHash":587013890,"text":"ん？そうか…","nextNodeIds":[710820215]},{"nodeId":710820215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1091461154,"text":"よく見ろよ、これは清心だろ？","nextNodeIds":[710820216]},{"nodeId":710820216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20553,"speakerName":"何爺","textMapHash":1531887562,"text":"はぁ、本当に清心だったのか。やっぱり少しめまいがする…","nextNodeIds":[710820217]},{"nodeId":710820217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":725186450,"text":"それに唐無仇、まさかおまえ、まだ琉璃百合大花園を作ろうとか、思ってないよな。","nextNodeIds":[710820218]},{"nodeId":710820218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20552,"speakerName":"「唐無仇」と自称する者","textMapHash":2252893242,"text":"ここで大きな琉璃百合大花園を作る。素晴らしい景色になると思わないか…","nextNodeIds":[710820219]},{"nodeId":710820219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2883069922,"text":"もうケンカするなよな。","nextNodeIds":[710820220]},{"nodeId":710820220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20553,"speakerName":"何爺","textMapHash":1230430818,"text":"はぁ、行くとするか、キノコもないし。","nextNodeIds":[710820221]},{"nodeId":710820221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20552,"speakerName":"「唐無仇」と自称する者","textMapHash":426174850,"text":"あの厄介者がいなくなって、やっと花を植えることを研究できるのに…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLM